sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户
  participant C as AssistantController
  participant A as AgentService
  participant L as LlmClient
  participant T as AgentToolkit
  participant V as PlanValidator
  participant S as PlanSaveService
  U->>C: POST /assistant/chats/{id}/messages
  C->>A: run (SSE)
  loop 最多 14 轮
    A->>L: chat + tools
    L-->>A: tool_calls / content
    A->>T: execute(tool, args)
    T-->>A: JSON 结果
  end
  A->>V: submit_plan 校验
  V-->>A: PlanDto / 错误
  A-->>U: SSE status/delta/plan/done
  U->>C: POST /plan/save
  C->>S: save(expectedPlanVersion)
  S-->>U: activityId / 409
